WEBVTT

00:11:58.329 --> 00:12:01.621
but that it could,
in combination with other things

00:12:01.662 --> 00:12:03.662
it could play an absolutely critical role.

00:12:03.704 --> 00:12:06.329
LHT: It depends on when
do you start the treatment.

00:12:06.371 --> 00:12:07.996
So if you start early --

00:12:08.037 --> 00:12:10.121
so that’s why we are now testing

00:12:10.121 --> 00:12:16.079
whether this approach can delay
the incidence of the disease.

00:12:16.121 --> 00:12:18.496
CA: If you start early enough,
you really believe,

00:12:18.537 --> 00:12:21.662
that alone could delay materially
the onset of Alzheimer's.

00:12:21.662 --> 00:12:23.996
LHT: We'll see,
we're starting a clinical trial.

00:12:24.621 --> 00:12:26.829
CA: Thank you so much,
thank you for your work.

00:12:26.871 --> 00:12:30.246
(Applause)